    "Id": "vehicledef_ALACORN_IIC_2",
    "Name": "Alacorn IIC-2",
    "Details": "Developed in 2587, the Alacorn attracted a reputation in the SLDF as an effective and dependable tank. Although some of the earliest versions mount various autocannons the Alacorn became famous for it's array of gauss rifles. This Clan upgraded Alacorn mounts three Hyper Assault Gauss Rifles 30s with 12 tons of ammo. Their combination of heavy punch and long range makes the Alacorn a threat to any unit on the field.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       350     50\n<b>Left</b>         275     50\n<b>Right</b>       275     50\n<b>Rear</b>        180     50\n<b>Turret</b>      270     50\n\n<b>Total</b>      1350    250</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Improved Communications</color>",
    "Icon": "Alacorn"
  },
